  "phi_lpf_square_base_diagonal_source_router_closed": true,
  "plain_conclusion": "virtual-unit seed 不能作为独立 composite signed row：`(p,1)` 是被 Phi-LPF 计数公式减掉的 prime row。每个 owner bucket 的最小真实 support key 是 square-base diagonal root `(p,p)`，它没有更小的 composite support predecessor；唯一 predecessor 是 virtual `(p,1)`。因此 seed 硬点进一步收窄为 `PhiLPFSquareBaseDiagonalRootSignedSourceDeclarationBeforePushforward`：必须在 Cauchy/Phi/payment 前对 `(p,p)` 同时给出 source tuple、basis word、signed coefficient、orientation/local factor、alpha/delta branch、ExactUV、推前前恒等式和 prime-row leak guard。",
  "pointwise_phi_lpf_bucket_signed_value_table_proved": false,
  "row_column_unconditional_closed": false,
  "same_theorem_target_preserved": true,
